// Sum of the labeled margins that appear on exactly one kept pair.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns that margin.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mosum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mosum rank

IMPULSE mosum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mosum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
